# {package}

The contract's declarations and policy generate a typed library Authority.
Run `cargo test --locked --offline` to check the decision examples, original
publication bytes, genesis and replay. `cargo run --locked --offline` checks
all decision examples. Unsigned decimal values retain all 128 bits.

The library exposes `authority`, `wire`, `genesis`, `examples` and `check`.
The Authority evaluates and publishes; these helpers only frame inputs and
compare complete decisions. The scaffold does not provide the signed SQLite
session or migration commands; passing an operational argument refuses with
`U128SubjectUnsupported`.

Regenerate contract data after editing `project.zeno` or `v2/policy.json`.
Examples describe intended behavior; generation alone does not establish it.
